lonely when you're around.","jump":"m_ex_alice_04_14"},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_13","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_13","text":"I'm not lonely, because I have my friends.","jump":"m_ex_alice_04_18"},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_14","text":"Oh!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_15","text":"Really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_16","text":"Then I've got to stay with you","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_17","text":"so that you don't ever die!","jump":"m_ex_alice_04_21"},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_18","text":"Oh, that's right!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_19","text":"You've got a whole bunch of friends fighting alongside you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_20","text":"In that case, you shouldn't be too lonely. That's a load of my mind.","jump":"m_ex_alice_04_21"},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_21","text":"Just to make sure... you're not going to die, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_22","text":"I'm not going anywhere.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_23","text":"That's a relief.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_24","text":"I was really scared for a second.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_25","text":"What exactly is this book that you're reading, anyway?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_26","text":"It was 101 facts about rabbits.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_27","text":"Oh, that reminds me!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_28","text":"It is said that off on a faraway star, there are rabbits who make super delicious rice cakes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_29","text":"I'd give anything to meet them.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_30","text":"I'm sure you'll be able to see them one day.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_31","text":"I hope you're right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_32","text":"Oh, Queen is calling. I've got to go.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_alice_04_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_alice_04_33","text":"See you around!","jump":null}],"chat":true}